	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "PLACEHOLDER footprint for Linx (TE) CONSMA020.042-G SMA jack, PCB edge mount, for 0.042in (1.07mm) boards -- this board is 1.048mm. Pads from Linx datasheet DS21264 Figure 2 \"Recommended PCB Dimensions\": top 3 pads at 4.24mm spacing, bottom 2 ground pads 8.48mm apart, 1.52 x 5.08mm, starting at the board edge (y = 0 here). The centre-pad width is read as the same 1.52mm as the ground pads from the drawing; that is much wider than a 50 ohm line on the 254um prepreg and needs a tapered transition / ground cut-back sized by EM simulation for 6.5GHz. Verify against Linx/TE drawing before fab.")
